Description: play music slower or at another pitch for practice
 Play it Slowly plays an audio file at a different speed without changing
 its pitch, or at a different pitch without changing its speed. It helps
 musicians learn and transcribe music.
 .
 It loops a section shown on a waveform, offers balance and mid/side modes,
 a count-in and number pad shortcuts, downloads the audio of YouTube videos
 and saves the result as WAV, MP3, Ogg Vorbis or FLAC.
